# Demo build-time Supabase config (Vite inlines VITE_* at build).
# The anon key is a PUBLIC client key — Row-Level Security (supabase migration
# 002_rls.sql) is the security boundary. NEVER put the service_role key here.
#
# IMPORTANT: the live demo only renders correctly once the Supabase project has
# the engine schema (migrations 001..007) and the Savannah seed applied. Until
# then, leaving these unset keeps the demo on its bundled JSON fallback.
